.TH ckman-fido-credentials-list 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-fido\-credentials\-list \- List resident credentials
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-fido\-credentials\-list\fR [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-pin\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-csv\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List resident credentials
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-pin\fR \fI<PIN>\fR
FIDO2 PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-csv\fR
Output full credential information as CSV
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
